{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Plan-and-Execute vs ReAct\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">对比 Plan-and-Execute 和 ReAct 两种 Agent 规划模式的区别，分析各自的优缺点和适用场景。在实际工程中如何设计混合架构？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心区别</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>ReAct</th>\n<th>Plan-and-Execute</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>核心思想</td>\n<td>边思考边做，每步动态决策</td>\n<td>先全局规划，再逐步执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划生成</td>\n<td>无完整计划，走一步看一步</td>\n<td>执行前生成完整步骤列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>高，每步可根据观察调整</td>\n<td>低，计划一旦生成按顺序执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局视角</td>\n<td>可能跑偏，缺乏全局观</td>\n<td>全局规划，步骤依赖清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 消耗</td>\n<td>每步都重新思考，消耗高</td>\n<td>规划一次执行多次，消耗低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>开放式探索、工具调用不确定</td>\n<td>流程型任务、步骤有强依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长任务表现</td>\n<td>容易迷失方向、重复调用</td>\n<td>结构清晰，不易偏离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Plan-and-Execute 的执行流程</strong>：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">输入任务 → Planner 生成完整计划 → 按步骤执行 → 观察结果 → Replan（如需）→ Final Answer\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>规划阶段</strong>：Planner（通常是强模型如 GPT-4）分析任务，生成完整的执行计划（步骤列表）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>执行阶段</strong>：Executor 按顺序执行每个步骤，可以调用工具</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>重规划</strong>：如果执行中发现计划不合理，触发 Replanner 调整计划</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>各自适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct 适合</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">短链路、动态决策任务（查订单、查天气）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">工具调用不确定，需要根据中间结果灵活调整</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">用户意图可能在对话中变化（客服场景）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">需要实时反馈的交互式任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Plan-and-Execute 适合</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">多步骤、长流程的复杂任务（数据分析报告、竞品分析）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">步骤之间有强先后依赖关系</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">执行顺序基本固定的流程型任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">需要预估资源消耗的任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>混合架构设计</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HybridAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"混合架构：Plan-and-Execute 做全局规划，ReAct 做局部灵活执行\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> planner_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> executor_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>planner <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> planner_llm   <span class=\"token comment\"># 强模型做规划</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>executor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> executor_llm <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行模型</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>replan_threshold <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.5</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 重规划触发阈值</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 全局规划</span>\n        plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_create_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Generated plan: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step_idx<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">enumerate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 每个步骤内部用 ReAct 灵活执行</span>\n            executor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ReActAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>executor<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_iterations<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            step_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> executor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 检查是否需要重规划</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_should_replan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                remaining_task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"已完成: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n剩余任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>step_idx<span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token format-spec\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n                plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_replanner<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>remaining_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> step_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Replanned: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_synthesize_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_create_plan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"将以下任务分解为可执行的步骤计划：\n任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n要求: \n- 每个步骤要具体、可执行\n- 标明步骤之间的依赖关系\n- 估计每个步骤的复杂度\n\n请输出 JSON 格式的计划:\"\"\"</span></span>\n        \n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>planner<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parse<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_should_replan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> step_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"判断是否需要重规划\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 工具调用失败、结果异常、偏离目标等情况</span>\n        error_indicators <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"failed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"unable\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"not found\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>indicator <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> step_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> indicator <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> error_indicators<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_replanner</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> failure_reason<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于失败原因重新规划\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"原始计划执行遇到问题，请重新规划：\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n失败原因: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>failure_reason<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n请输出调整后的计划:\"\"\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parse<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>planner<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>工程实践建议</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>分层策略</strong>：简单查询（单步任务）走 ReAct 单次循环；复杂任务（多步骤）先用 Plan-and-Execute 生成粗粒度 Plan，每个步骤内部用 ReAct 执行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Planner 选型</strong>：规划用强模型（如 GPT-4），执行可以用更快更便宜的模型（如 GPT-3.5）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>重规划触发条件</strong>：工具调用失败、结果不符合预期、用户意图变化</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>监控指标</strong>：规划准确率、重规划频率、步骤成功率、端到端延迟</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：Plan-and-Execute 中的\"规划谬误\"怎么解决？答：规划中预留 buffer 步骤、设置重规划触发条件、使用更保守的复杂度估计。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：如果执行中发现某步不可行怎么办？答：触发 Replanner，基于已完成的步骤和失败原因重新生成剩余计划。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：多 Agent 场景下如何协调 Planning？答：可以使用 Master Agent 做全局规划，子 Agent 各自执行分配到的子任务。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：认为必须二选一。实际上混合架构往往效果最好。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：Plan-and-Execute 中规划一次就不再调整。实际需要动态重规划能力。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：忽视 Planner 和执行器的模型选型差异。规划需要强推理能力，执行可以更轻量。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>","headings":[]}